      "message": "@drott and @fmalita, can you PTAL?\n\nI am not quite happy with having an ad-hoc helper for Rust-vs-`libpng` dispatching inside Fontations-related code (rather than in `src/codec/...`).  But this seems okay for now, as a first step:\n\n* In the future, we will also need this kind of dispatching in `SkIcoCodec.cpp` and `SkSVGOpenTypeSVGDecoder.cpp`, but I know that Chromium uses Fontations, but I am not sure if Chromium uses `SkIcoCodec` (vs Chromium/Blink-specific decoders).\n* The helper introduced in this CL is focused on Fontation-specific needs (e.g. taking only the `sk_sp\u003cSkData\u003e` parameter).\n* This CL helps to make progress toward shipping Rust PNG.\n\nWDYT?",
